<title>USA: M.A. Hanna says names Douglas McGregor CEO.</title>
<headline>M.A. Hanna says names Douglas McGregor CEO.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>M.A. Hanna Co said Douglas McGregor was named chief executive officer on Thursday, succeeding 64-year old Martin Walker.</p>
<p>The succession, effective from January 1, is part of a management succession program instituted several years earlier, it said.</p>
<p>McGregor, 55, currently holds the post of president and chief operating officer.  Walker will remain chairman of the board through June 30, 1997, retiring thereafter, the company said.</p>
